arm64: dts: violet: microphone (LPASS LPI, SoundWire v1.5, WCD937x capture), PDR, BOB mode

LPI node at 0x62b52000 with vendor SoundWire/reset pin states; WCD937x reset on LPI gpio6 (vendor
gpio24) with a default-only pinctrl state (a 'sleep' state that drives reset low is applied by ASoC
when the component is idle and held the codec in reset); SWRM v1.5.1; TX port map <2 3 4 5>; mic bias
2.6 V from BOB (vendor); BOB initial mode AUTO (vendor pass-through has no mainline mode); PDR on
q6afe/q6asm/q6adm (needs CONFIG_QCOM_PD_MAPPER=y); TX_CODEC_DMA_TX_3 capture link with vendor AMIC routing.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/violet-sm6150.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/violet-sm6150.dts
@@ -645,10 +645,11 @@
